        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" xmlns:default="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" ezremote:id="23815" ezremote:identifier="description" name="Description" type="ezxmltext">
          <default:section xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:ezxhtml="http://ibexa.co/xmlns/dxp/docbook/xhtml" xmlns:ezcustom="http://ibexa.co/xmlns/dxp/docbook/custom" version="5.0-variant ezpublish-1.0">
            <default:para>Workout motivation can be… a little hard to come by sometimes. Finding that little piece of inspiration that gives you fitness motivation, and then STAYING motivated to work out and keep up with a healthy lifestyle… that’s even harder to come by.</default:para>
            <default:para>The concept of “motivation” is pretty elusive, especially when you’re talking about something so random as workout motivation, or fitness motivation, or even just healthy lifestyle motivation. In this video I share 5 tips for getting motivated to workout, and a few tricks that make it easier to STAY motivated (which is the hardest part!)</default:para>
          </default:section>
